u0131<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>11. S\u0131n\u0131f E\u011fitim Program\u0131m\u0131z, okul notlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00fcksek tutarken TYT haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in sa\u011flam bir altyap\u0131 olu\u015fturur. Haftal\u0131k 12 saat m\u00fcfredat dersleri ve 6 saat TYT \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131yla, \u00f6\u011frencilerimiz iki y\u0131l sonraki s\u0131nava sistematik olarak haz\u0131rlanmaya ba\u015flar. D\u00fczenli denemeler, ment\u00f6rl\u00fck deste\u011fi ve bire bir \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalarla \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin performans\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrekli takip ediyoruz.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":35068,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","course_category":[47,28],"course_tag":[],"class_list":["post-35037","lp_course","type-lp_course","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","course_category-11-sinif-egitim-programlari","course_category-tum-kurslar","course"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>11. S\u0131n\u0131f E\u011fitim Kursu - Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat E\u011fitim<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Okul notlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 y\u00fckseltirken TYT i\u00e7in sa\u011flam bir altyap\u0131 olu\u015fturun! Haftal\u0131k 14 saat m\u00fcfredat dersi, 6 saat TYT \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 ve S.E.S ile s\u0131navlara 11. s\u0131n\u0131ftan y\u00f6n verin.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/kurslar\/11-sinif-egitim-kursu-tyt-hazirlik-gaziosmanpasa-murat-egitim\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"tr_TR\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"11. S\u0131n\u0131f E\u011fitim Kursu - Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat 